BDegb0NqYhyAz8M6iPpL2W1ncMOOMQSpdU9hSqMETUTA&oe=6A4E6944"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YlhM-7SQHI4Q7kNvwEP2I9n&_nc_oc=AdpmIiPLd30ajGSGoP8NEQZ4SB3QPEzrviurE9pP-xX38gEQeeyQd54-2YKr8VXWCVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCbx1axbNDHgbQrhAA_pM14LR3kGKakmhoylLc4YQFz_A&oe=6A4E4DE2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VJr4eAy-PkIQ7kNvwFZ2OxM&_nc_oc=Ado12iVsIMQkz77CelvnRlz0VP69fVQpH2kn3gj77QIhmNtwHWwZyYnH6IO-1lUY3h0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA42SXDa11jL0v0Av9Jp9S-V8mjMceUv1Rn4IEizJpVRg&oe=6A4E37F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=122i4hkOLOoQ7kNvwGFxy6j&_nc_oc=Adrr0m-3DlVs60FRLFx8THqASj616g5w8aAZPcKrs_miYsYaVcEXeeCg2VB6wC0MM5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAPOvhT2qq9Vo6kuOG8hEW_Om-vVhqLONrzTm1sRY982Q&oe=6A4E6F2F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Iv24_yp4KQQ7kNvwGaSf0N&_nc_oc=AdoWFpLzcucJLSLG3giA8Quc3JVtNRqFbDjrVNzGaQ4auFZuvau-7XSMEYapKrCL5eQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBt5WKbn7r9cbTA7VZOt3Zfq02v9_dvr_M5Vjo3CeJI1A&oe=6A4E6B25"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_ekkGIZEWHIQ7kNvwEipmQ9&_nc_oc=Adq1hGrDTrWK4iP8JlSXBnS72sMDcV3L4vQVjBsC3DgI9dAicJQkKvTnv9R_mKzvlvw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBE3J9NA-yZcgg-sS1qfMAN5ZdLTQvMUkB_6wMsPdAgZg&oe=6A4E6A0D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8jRv1LmKW48Q7kNvwHVmllf&_nc_oc=AdofhgtBjyfL22uZpomW2Rs4r8AsQJj5xXlN7YsPTtY6piyc-9Le4qardmId_dhRnIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=